"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nI wanted to try a proper juicy Western-style burger, so I looked up a well-known spot and headed there.\n\nOrdered both Classic single and Charrd single.  \nBoth were good, but the signature menu named after the restaurant was clearly the better one.\n\n\n\nThe Charrd single had a subtle truffle aroma with layers of complex flavors that all came together really well.  \nThe Classic single was just straightforwardly delicious.\n\nIt went viral on social media and has reportedly been ranked as high as 14th in the world burger rankings.  \nI braced myself for a long queue since it's known for that, but thankfully the wait was shorter than expected.  \n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"